{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Banner of Conquest</strong> is a survivors-like game set against the backdrop of the Three Kingdoms period. In this game, you will take on the role of a famous general from the Three Kingdoms, growing stronger through relentless battles. Activate the power of your inner martial soul, face increasingly powerful foes, and strive to dominate the Central Plains.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2483730/extras/\u65a9\u5c06gif1.gif?t=1745463627\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2483730/extras/EN.png?t=1745463627\" /></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose from nearly 20 famous Three Kingdoms generals, each with unique skills to match your playstyle.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2483730/extras/xuanren.gif?t=1745463627\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Select from dozens of different weapons. A special weapon crafting system allows even simple blades to be upgraded into legendary weapons with immense power.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2483730/extras/xueyuangif.gif?t=1745463627\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">On the ever-changing battlefield, you'll need to quickly dodge enemy attacks and carve a path through the chaos. Defeat enemies to collect resources, and use these to purchase new weapons and gear before the next wave arrives.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2483730/extras/zhugebattle.gif?t=1745463627\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Embark on your Three Kingdoms journey, conquer the five passes, defeat six generals, and see if you have what it takes to rule the Central Plains.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"My Coins","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2483730/555b839cf91ee043b30d9faf303af70114053847.jpg"},{"name":"My Treasury","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2483730/b1164eeb5558643c526170f31d61a703276266d8.jpg"},{"name":"Prosperous Year","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2483730/ab876c918ebe7a21ea16a9e735861f1f6fb4c347.jpg"},{"name":"Prosperous Era","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2483730/c1904c97ff82089009b102aa676ffaf555a215a3.jpg"},{"name":"What's in here?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2483730/203fc9f53caab107dbf832ab89e229118fbc9595.jpg"},{"name":"My precious!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2483730/b50b0a5434f08974ba06a02675363a9d269b08bd.jpg"},{"name":"There's always one that doesn't suit you","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2483730/699446d7ca84a2b0d1215d1a93d37a54f920b92a.jpg"},{"name":"What's in this filling?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2483730/02fea0c68f5cb07f8d6fc664a00f7ff1c24dc4c5.jpg"},{"name":"Can't take it with one hand","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2483730/b4c188219b3889b958971bcfb9ceb18bc33eea22.jpg"},{"name":"Cheers!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2483730/5ad178d0ae0729b1b378e5c00df4b015758d9c30.jpg"}],"total":53},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2483730?t=1745463627","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2483730?t=1745463627","capsule_image":"h